{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Start a paid image job. Request needs model and prompt; max_cost_rub is optional. Supports n/num_images up to 10 (per-model limits still apply).\nKling Image 4.0 models:\n- kling-4-image: native 2K/4K/8K (no 1K), result_type=\"single\" (1-9) or \"series\" (2-10), up to 10 reference_image_urls (@Image1..@Image10) and up to 7 elements (@Element1..@Element7, each with frontal_image_url + 1-3 reference_image_urls; requires >= 1 reference_image_urls; refs + elements <= 10).\n- kling-4-long-image: single long vertical layout (1K/2K); skill=\"webpage\" (default; optional style_image_url @StyleImage and subject_image_url @SubjectImage) or skill=\"ecommerce\" (length short/medium/long, 1-3 required reference_image_urls @Image1..@Image3). 8K, series and long layouts can take 1-4 minutes.\nRunway Gen-4 Image models:\n- runway-gen4-image (0-3 reference_image_urls, 720p/1080p, 1 image) and runway-gen4-image-turbo (1-3 required reference_image_urls, flat rate, 1 image): optional reference_tags (up to 3 tags matching ^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{2,15}$, default ref1..ref3) referenced in prompt as @tag (prompt <= 1000 UTF-16); optional seed.\nFor topaz-image-upscale, crystal-upscale or runway-image-upscale use create_image_upscale.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"ImageGeneration":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"aspect_ratio":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Aspect Ratio"},"background":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["auto","opaque","transparent"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Background mode for models advertising 'transparent_background' in features (GPT Image 2.6, Seedream 5.5). 'transparent' cannot be combined with output_format='jpeg'.","title":"Background"},"complexity":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["low","medium","high"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Complexity"},"creativity":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["raw","low","medium","high"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Creativity"}